Victor, it's not...

02:04:31.320 --> 02:04:32.460
Because I don't have faith.

02:04:33.000 --> 02:04:34.460
Trust in me for a while yet.

02:04:35.570 --> 02:04:36.630
We are so close.

02:04:37.950 --> 02:04:38.770
Why so quickly?

02:04:39.370 --> 02:04:39.850
Why tonight?

02:04:40.070 --> 02:04:40.930
I feel remost.

02:04:42.750 --> 02:04:47.240
I keep hearing those cries of heresy and blasphemy.

02:04:49.740 --> 02:04:50.180
Meditating.

02:04:53.080 --> 02:04:53.890
I go again.

02:04:56.200 --> 02:04:57.840
No, you've succeeded.

02:05:00.920 --> 02:05:09.870
I have created the strongest, most brilliant, powerful man that ever existed.

02:05:16.480 --> 02:05:19.520
Come, we will drink on it before we begin work.

02:05:22.440 --> 02:05:26.570
A little time to be beautiful.

02:05:28.680 --> 02:05:28.940
No, no.

02:05:30.880 --> 02:05:34.310
Victor, even if we assemble the body, we have no heart.

02:05:37.580 --> 02:05:38.840
Storm isn't due until morning.

02:05:40.940 --> 02:05:42.080
We will have a heart when it comes.

02:05:54.840 --> 02:05:55.670
Quick, out this way.

02:06:06.140 --> 02:06:08.620
too serious. He's lost too much blood.

02:06:08.780 --> 02:06:13.960
It must be something we can do. If we can create

02:06:13.960 --> 02:06:15.360
life, we should be able to save it.

02:06:18.180 --> 02:06:23.770
We've done everything we can. We can help him.

02:06:26.060 --> 02:06:28.670
Professor Miller. He couldn't help.

02:06:29.120 --> 02:06:29.840
He's one of the best.

02:06:30.000 --> 02:06:34.340
in the country. We must get him. Victor, he'd see everything he knew what we were doing. I don't

02:06:34.340 --> 02:06:46.080
care. Get him now. No. He must lie still. Go get me. No. Don't waste time. I can do nothing to go on

02:06:46.080 --> 02:06:57.150
with the experiment. The experiment is over. No. Hugo, we can't. And even if we don't have time. Don't waste time you can. My heart will.

02:07:00.060 --> 02:07:15.000
understand i could never do that i want you to i'm begging you be immortal my death means something

02:08:38.600 --> 02:08:52.800
father with elizabeth and henry clavel well i can see we've come just in time look at him

02:08:53.180 --> 02:08:58.330
sleeping in his clothes is there sleep no i've been working all night my friend alto

02:08:58.330 --> 02:08:59.750
we're in the midst of an important experiment

02:09:00.000 --> 02:09:01.960
a crucial point. We might have

02:09:01.960 --> 02:09:04.080
known it. You forgot all about us coming.

02:09:04.800 --> 02:09:06.380
No, no. I thought you were

02:09:06.380 --> 02:09:08.180
in Geneva. I wrote you that Henry

02:09:08.180 --> 02:09:10.370
was coming. Yes, I'm studying languages at the

02:09:10.370 --> 02:09:12.330
university. Ah. That is, if I don't

02:09:12.330 --> 02:09:14.210
freeze to death standing here. I am

02:09:14.210 --> 02:09:16.290
glad to see you. When Henry gave us the news

02:09:16.290 --> 02:09:18.270
I decided Elizabeth and I would come too.

02:09:18.390 --> 02:09:20.030
Well, you must be tired. Let me send you to the inn.

02:09:22.140 --> 02:09:22.940
What hospitality?

02:09:23.600 --> 02:09:25.140
Not even a cup of coffee for your

02:09:25.140 --> 02:09:27.140
father and your fiancé? And I want

02:09:27.140 --> 02:09:29.320
to see where you live, your laboratory, everything.

02:09:29.500 --> 02:09:29.960
Is this the way to...

02:09:30.120 --> 02:09:37.740
drawing room actually i'm sorry i'm very busy now i must get back to my work you see well let us come

02:09:37.740 --> 02:09:44.210
with you i'm interested to see what you're doing no father i can't it would disturb things i'm sorry

02:09:45.930 --> 02:09:58.810
i'll see you to the end wait here please at water receptions victor looks exhausted oh boy

02:10:00.000 --> 02:10:03.000
I can't understand why he didn't get Elizabeth's letter.

02:10:03.800 --> 02:10:05.500
Perhaps this word leaves him a little time for reading.

02:10:05.920 --> 02:10:07.300
Why wouldn't he let us upstairs?

02:10:07.970 --> 02:10:10.050
Why should he keep his work a secret from us?

02:10:12.580 --> 02:10:16.680
I'll take him to the end.

02:10:17.810 --> 02:10:18.690
I'll be back as soon as I can.

02:10:18.770 --> 02:10:19.550
You stay and keep working.

02:10:20.110 --> 02:10:21.690
What are we going to do about Hugo's body, Victor?

02:10:21.770 --> 02:10:22.710
What are we going to tell people?

02:10:25.160 --> 02:10:27.160
Say he went for a climb in the mountains,

02:10:28.350 --> 02:10:29.850
his body will never be found.

02:10:31.370 --> 02:10:32.090
We bury it here.
